# Spider Food: its one target is Bot2's Ornithopter. Bot2 kills it with Lightning Bolt in response, so the target is illegal as the
# spell resolves and, with its only target illegal, the spell does not resolve (CR 608.2b): no Food token comes, though the
# token sentence has no target of its own.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Spider Food
Forest x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Spider Food.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield =

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Graveyard = Spider Food; Black Lotus
